  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bihar BSSC Office Attendant Mains Answer Key 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-05T12:20:13+05:30\">June 5, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">12:20 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://dst.bihar.gov.in/\">Department of Science &amp; Technology, Govt of Bihar</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Mains Answer Key </strong>on the <strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Office Attendant (Karyaly Parichari)&nbsp;Examination 2025</strong>. The mains exam was conducted on <strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"175\">26 May 2026</strong>, and the last date to submit the application form was&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"250\">31th October 2022</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Mains Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Bihar BSSC Office Attendant Mains Answer Key 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Bihar DST Office Attendant Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bihar-bssc-office-attendant-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>23 September 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>31 October 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong>&nbsp;11 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>01 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key :<strong> 04 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pre Result : <strong>04 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mains Exam Date <strong>: 26 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mains Admit Card : <strong>14 May 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mains Answer Key :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 04 June 2026</strong></span> <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>Bihar DST</strong><b>&nbsp;</b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General/ OBC/ EWS</strong> <strong>: ₹ 00/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ PwD : ₹ 00/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Bihar DST Office Attendant Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 January 2022</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>37 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years Female</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Bihar DST</strong> provides age relaxation for the<strong> Office Attendant </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">238 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">Bihar DST Office Attendant Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 77px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; height: 27px; width: 167.113%;\" colspan=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong>&nbsp;Category Wise Vacancy Details&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong><br>\n</strong></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 21.3418%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.1318%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>General</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7232%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>EBC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7233%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>EWS</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.904%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.9205%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>ST</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 80.3688%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>BC Female</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 21.3418%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Office Attendant (Karyaly Parichari)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.1318%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>99</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7232%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>40</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.7233%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>24</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.904%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>65</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.9205%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>02</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 80.3688%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>08</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Bihar DST Office Attendant Recruitment 2022 : </span>Eligibility Criteria&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates who have <strong>passed the Class 10th (High School)</strong> exam from any recognized board or university in India can apply for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For More Details Read <strong>Bihar DST</strong> Official Notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/secl-apprentice-recruitment-2025/\"><strong>SECL Apprentice Online Form 2025</strong></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download Bihar BSSC Office Attendant Mains Answer Key 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w21z4y\" data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"264\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong>official website</strong> of</span><br data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"219\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Bihar Staff Selection Commission</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"iw3g8x\" data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"345\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, go to the <strong data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"335\">“Notices / Important Announcements”</strong> section</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14x7xof\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"438\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the link:</span><br data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"371\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"438\">“Office Attendant (Karyalay Parichari) Mains Answer Key 2026”</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1e4wz4a\" data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"482\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Open the <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"480\">official exam notice PDF</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aqy75g\" data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"542\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Check the section mentioning <strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"540\">Answer Key</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1349zgj\" data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"605\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download and <strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"582\">save/print the PDF</strong> for future reference</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Bihar DST Office Attendant Recruitment 2025 : </span>Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Written Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><