: 100%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong>&nbsp;Bihar BSSC Office Attendant Mains Answer Key 2026 : Important Question&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 101px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 101px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q. When will the BSSC Office Attendant Mains Answer Key 2026 be released?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>A.</strong> The answer key is released<strong data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"229\"> after the examination.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 101px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 101px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q. Where can I download the answer key?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>A.</strong> You can download it from the official website of the <strong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"455\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Bihar Staff Selection Commission</span></span> (BSSC).</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q. Is it mandatory to carry the admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>A.</strong> Yes, the admit card is compulsory<strong> for entry into the examination hall.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q. What if there is an error in the admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>A.</strong> Contact BSSC authority immediately<strong> for correction before the exam date.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td sty